0..68 Comment "// Paths whose endpoints call a recursive operation of a data block."
69..71 Comment "//"
72..147 Comment "// The kernel replays each path that the checker admits. So the two engines"
148..220 Comment "// must reduce a call of the operation at an endpoint to the same value."
221..223 Comment "//"
224..298 Comment "// The operation\'s rules compute the call. A path by reflexivity reads the"
299..378 Comment "// call at its endpoint, and the checker and the kernel reduce it to one value."
379..381 Comment "//"
382..452 Comment "// - see: #4291 — `zeroPlusZero`, `zeroIsZeroPlusZero`, `onePlusOne`"
